<<^ code=`&#x0001;` from=`?` to=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.approval.signs`>>
<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "add this vault's seats to an approval once its digest reads"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///realm.approval.signs", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.approval.signs"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.approval.signs"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.approval.signs ~ a person names the digest before the seats sign

`lares nexus approve sign <approval> confirm-statement=<digest> [confirm-hash=<hash>] [nexus=<aid>] out=<approval>` adds the seats held in this vault to an approval, once the person names the statement digest `open` printed (and may name the bytes hash).

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ sign

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`sign` params=`file/a.json confirm-statement/<digest> out/a.json ~ cosign an approval`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ file · confirm-statement · confirm-hash · nexus · out

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`file` params=`takes/host-path needs/required seat/1 as/<approval> ~ the approval`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`confirm-statement` params=`takes/digest needs/required ~ the statement digest as read aloud`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`confirm-hash` params=`takes/hash ~ the bytes hash`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nexus` params=`takes/aid ~ the Nexus, by AID; absent, the primary charter's`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`out` params=`takes/host-path ~ the grown approval`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ quorum

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`quorum` params=`who/hand key/seat ~ the seats held in this vault sign`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[realm.approval.signs file/a.json confirm-statement/<digest> out/a.json]] ~ a missing approval, digest or out=`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ signed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`signed` params=`exit/0 ~ the approval grew`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares nexus approve sign

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares nexus approve sign]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~/ahu>>

